WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:02,860
I should be able to recognize the correct key now

2
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:04,380
If you find it, hide it first

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,240
I can't completely trust that team leader

4
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:07,640
Gotta keep a trump card

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:10,440
did you hear anything

6
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:13,820
It should be the players coming up from the floor below.

7
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,100
I didn’t expect that there would be players running up to me at this time.

8
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:18,520
what are you doing

9
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:23,910
Did you see what just ran past? It seems like

10
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:28,070
It seems that the Rou family ran after two Guiyi. You know him. He is an old player.

11
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:29,550
I don't know

12
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:31,510
He shouldn't be an old player

13
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:33,430
In such a dangerous copy

14
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:35,190
If the Rou family dies, they die.

15
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:36,470
As long as the Rou family dies

16
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:39,270
My previous dark history has been completely buried.

17
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:41,590
But why is Guiyi chased by him?

18
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:50,380
Tools for cutting off sounds

19
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:58,940
Sure enough, the NPC behind me has a scary attitude?

20
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,740
In fact, it's quite exciting to be chased like this.

21
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:12,680
Drive me, no need to throw people away

22
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:15,040
It brings back the feeling of parkour in the classroom in junior high school
